Output docs/vhs/out/05-grpc-unary-reflection.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "export SENDITO_KEYCHAIN=memory && cd /tmp/sendito-demo && clear" Enter
Show
Type "sendito" Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "/echo" Enter Enter Sleep 500ms Tab Enter Sleep 1500ms Escape F5 Sleep 1500ms
Ctrl+W Type "j" Alt+4 Sleep 1500ms
Ctrl+Q
